# Claude Code: commit the notification hook's mechanism, never its secrets or
# runtime state. notify.env holds the ntfy topic (a bearer capability); the log
# holds verbatim hook payloads, including prompt text and transcript paths.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
/.claude/hooks/*
!/.claude/hooks/notify.sh
!/.claude/hooks/notify.env.example
!/.claude/hooks/README.md